<title>USA: US Mint buys 2,964,000 kg zinc at avg $1.2305/kg.</title>
<headline>US Mint buys 2,964,000 kg zinc at avg $1.2305/kg.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Mint on Thursday said it bought a total of 2,964,000 kg special high grade zinc from three firms at an average price of $1.2305 per kg.</p>
<p>It bought 1,783,000 kg of zinc from Ore &amp; Chemical Co for $1.2377 per kg. It bought 637,000 kg of zinc from Bal Metal for $1.2217 per kg, and 544,000 kg of zinc from Hochschild Partners for $1.2323 per kg.</p>
</text>
